# Growth allometry of Paphies

Estimate the allometry of shell height on length across individuals as a reduced-major-axis regression of log10(height) on log10(length).

Report in `results`: `slope`, `intercept` and `n` (individuals).

Write `answer.json` following `answer.schema.json`.

# Paphies valve measurements

- `catalogue.csv`: the collection catalogue: `specimen_id`, `individual_id` (the animal the valve belongs to), `valve` (R or L) and `locality`.
- `measurements.csv`: `specimen_id`, `length_mm`, `height_mm`, measured per valve.

